- **Artifact:** This folder (`R310/p01_ttp/`)

### L13 TECHNOLOGY_TRANSFER_READY
- **Timestamp:** NOT YET
- **Description:** P-01 is NOT YET TECHNOLOGY_TRANSFER_READY. Blocking items:
  - L10 (independent verification) not yet executed
