## Summary

P-01 has progressed from HYPOTHESIS (R276) through MODEL, ATTACK, FAIL, DIAGNOSIS, REPAIR, RETEST, ECONOMIC_PROOF, and TTP assembly (R310). The remaining gap is L10 (independent verification) and L03 (external simulator cross-check), both pending SIM_SVFSI execution.

**R311 priority for P-01:** Execute SIM_SVFSI cross-check. If MODEL_VERIFIED, P-01 becomes the first TECHNOLOGY_TRANSFER_READY candidate.
